{"id":"n1-174","title":"Verbる や否や (Verb-ru ya ina ya)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses the idea of 'as soon as', 'the moment...'.","longExplanation":"The grammar point Verbる や否や is used to express something happening immediately after another action or event. It can be translated as 'as soon as...' or 'the moment...'. The verb must be in dictionary form.","formation":"Verb-dictionary form + や否や","examples":[{"jp":"彼女が家に帰るや否や、すぐにテレビをつけました。","romaji":"Kanojo ga ie ni kaeru ya ina ya, sugu ni terebi o tsukemashita.","en":"As soon as she returned home, she turned on the TV.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"家","vocabId":"1191730","reading":"いえ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"帰る","vocabId":"1221270","reading":"かえる"},{"surface":"や","vocabId":null},{"surface":"否","vocabId":"2857380","reading":"いや"},{"surface":"や","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すぐ","vocabId":"1430610","reading":"すぐ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"テレビ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"つけ","vocabId":"1495750","reading":"つけ","baseForm":"つける"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]},{"jp":"私が郵便箱を開けるや否や、手紙が落ちました。","romaji":"Watashi ga yuubinbako o akeru ya ina ya, tegami ga ochimashita.","en":"The moment I opened the mailbox, the letters fell out.","words":[{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"郵便箱","vocabId":"1747030","reading":"ゆうびんばこ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"開ける","vocabId":"1202450","reading":"あける"},{"surface":"や","vocabId":null},{"surface":"否","vocabId":"2857380","reading":"いや"},{"surface":"や","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"手紙","vocabId":"1327720","reading":"てがみ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"落ち","vocabId":"1548530","reading":"おち","baseForm":"落ちる"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]},{"jp":"子供たちは学校が終わるや否や、公園に走りました。","romaji":"Kodomo-tachi wa gakkou ga owaru ya ina ya, kouen ni hashirimashita.","en":"As soon as school was over, the children ran to the park.","words":[{"surface":"子供","vocabId":"1307850","reading":"こども"},{"surface":"たち","vocabId":"1416220","reading":"たち"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"学校","vocabId":"1206730","reading":"がっこう"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"終わる","vocabId":"1589600","reading":"おわる"},{"surface":"や","vocabId":null},{"surface":"否","vocabId":"2857380","reading":"いや"},{"surface":"や","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"公園","vocabId":"1273270","reading":"こうえん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"走り","vocabId":"1402420","reading":"はしり","baseForm":"走る"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6,7,8]},{"jp":"父が新聞を読むや否や、何かに震えていました。","romaji":"Chichi ga shinbun o yomu ya ina ya, nanika ni furuete imashita.","en":"The moment my father read the newspaper, he started trembling about something.","words":[{"surface":"父","vocabId":"1497610","reading":"ちち"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"新聞","vocabId":"1362360","reading":"しんぶん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"読む","vocabId":"1456360","reading":"よむ"},{"surface":"や","vocabId":null},{"surface":"否","vocabId":"2857380","reading":"いや"},{"surface":"や","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"何","vocabId":"1577100","reading":"なに"},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"震え","vocabId":"1366300","reading":"ふるえ","baseForm":"震える"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","v